Package: browserrenderer-mcp
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: browserrenderer-mcp maintainers <root@localhost>
Depends: nodejs (>= 18), chromium, fonts-liberation, ca-certificates, adduser, systemd
Recommends: fonts-noto-core, fonts-noto-cjk
Section: web
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/microsoft/playwright-mcp
Description: Headless browser rendering over MCP with watchlist and email alerts
 Runs Microsoft's unmodified @playwright/mcp as a hardened loopback-only systemd
 service, and a small gateway service that is the public MCP endpoint. The
 gateway proxies every browser tool of the stock server unchanged and adds
 watchlist and email-alert tools. SMTP credentials live only in the gateway
 process, never in the browser process. Intended to sit behind a tunnel or
 reverse proxy that provides authentication.
